msgstr "Síntoma"

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/troubleshooting/nvidia_slow_response.rst:14
msgid ""
"Qwen3-32B on one GPU keeps its memory allocated and utilization near 100%, while "
"Qwen2.5-VL on another GPU responds normally. Even a short probe waits; one recorded "
"greeting returned about 40 minutes later as GPU utilization fell."
msgstr ""
"Qwen3-32B en una GPU mantiene su memoria asignada y una utilización cercana al 100 %,"
" mientras que Qwen2.5-VL en otra GPU responde con normalidad. Incluso una sonda breve"
" queda en espera; un saludo documentado obtuvo respuesta unos 40 minutos después, a "
"medida que bajaba la utilización de la GPU."

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/troubleshooting/nvidia_slow_response.rst
msgid "Observed"
msgstr "Observado"

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/troubleshooting/nvidia_slow_response.rst:18
msgid ""
"Another model on the same machine remained responsive. High GPU utilization shows "
"active computation but does not distinguish many requests from one long-running "
"request."
msgstr ""
"Otro modelo en la misma máquina seguía respondiendo. Una utilización elevada de la "
"GPU indica cómputo activo, pero no distingue entre muchas solicitudes y una única "
"solicitud de larga duración."

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/troubleshooting/nvidia_slow_response.rst
msgid "Hypothesis"
msgstr "Hipótesis"

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/troubleshooting/nvidia_slow_response.rst:19
msgid ""
"Long prompts, large token budgets, thinking output or a queue may occupy this model "
"instance. The root cause was not confirmed in the record."
msgstr ""
"Los prompts largos, los presupuestos de tokens grandes, la salida de razonamiento "
"(thinking) o una cola pueden ocupar esta instancia del modelo. La causa raíz no se "
"confirmó en el informe."

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/troubleshooting/nvidia_slow_response.rst:22
msgid "Logs and request correlation"
msgstr "Registros y correlación de solicitudes"

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/troubleshooting/nvidia_slow_response.rst:24
msgid ""
"In the recorded Xinference 1.0.3 context, chat entry and exit messages use DEBUG "
"logging. Model subprocess logs may differ from the worker's main log; absent chat "
"messages in that file do not prove the request never reached the model."
msgstr ""
"En el contexto documentado de Xinference 1.0.3, los mensajes de entrada y salida del "
"chat usan el nivel de registro DEBUG. Los registros de los subprocesos del modelo "
"pueden diferir del registro principal del worker; la ausencia de mensajes de chat en "
"ese archivo no demuestra que la solicitud nunca llegara al modelo."

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/troubleshooting/nvidia_slow_response.rst:27
msgid "Mitigation and diagnostics"
msgstr "Mitigación y diagnóstico"

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/troubleshooting/nvidia_slow_response.rst:29
msgid ""
"The notes recommend streaming, a bounded token budget, a unique request identifier "
"and disabling thinking where the engine supports it. The following is the recorded "
"client request configuration; keep client-specific fields in the format expected by "
"your SDK."
msgstr ""
"Las notas recomiendan streaming, un presupuesto de tokens acotado, un identificador "
"de solicitud único y desactivar el razonamiento (thinking) cuando el motor lo admita."
" A continuación se muestra la configuración de solicitud del cliente documentada; "
"mantenga los campos específicos del cliente en el formato que espera su SDK."

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/troubleshooting/nvidia_slow_response.rst:42
msgid ""
"Use a small ``request_limits`` value, such as 1 or 2, when reproducing the case. Add "
"concurrency, timeout and queue limits at the entry layer so short requests do not "
"wait indefinitely behind long ones."
msgstr ""
"Utilice un valor pequeño de  ``request_limits`` , como 1 o 2, al reproducir el caso. "
"Añada límites de concurrencia, tiempo de espera y cola en la capa de entrada para que"
" las solicitudes cortas no esperen indefinidamente detrás de las largas."

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/troubleshooting/nvidia_slow_response.rst:45
msgid "Verification"
msgstr "Verificación"

#. Machine-translated technical prose; navigation reviewed and references preserved.
#: ../../source/troubleshooting/nvidia_slow_response.rst:47
msgid ""
"Compare the same prompt on an idle instance and under load. Correlate request "
"identifiers with model logs and record first-token latency, total latency and whether"
" output completes. Treat these measures as diagnostic evidence, not confirmation of "
"the proposed cause."
msgstr ""
"Compare el mismo prompt en una instancia inactiva y bajo carga. Correlacione los "
"identificadores de solicitud con los registros del modelo y anote la latencia del "
"primer token, la latencia total y si la salida llega a completarse. Trate estas "
"medidas como evidencia de diagnóstico, no como confirmación de la causa propuesta."

